#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:51
msgid ""
"After clicking the <guilabel>Register</guilabel> link, the terms and "
"conditions of registering will be displayed, which you must accept to "
"proceed. Some websites will ask you to select whether you are under the age "
"of thirteen in order to comply with <acronym>COPPA</acronym> (the United "
"States' Children's Online Privacy Protection Act of 1998; more details can "
"be found at <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.coppa.org\">http://www.coppa.org</ulink>). If you are "
"younger than thirteen years of age, your account will stay inactive until it"
" is approved by a parent or guardian. You will receive an e-mail in which "
"the next steps required for your account activation are outlined."
msgstr ""
"Efter du har klikket på linket <guilabel>Tilmeld</guilabel>, vises "
"tilmeldingsbetingelserne, som du skal acceptere for at fortsætte. Nogle "
"websites vil bede dig angive om du er under 13 år, for at overholde "
"<acronym>COPPA</acronym> (den amerikanske lov Children's Online Privacy "
"Protection Act af 1998; læs mere på <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.coppa.org\">http://www.coppa.org</ulink>). Er du under 13 "
"år, forbliver din konto inaktiv indtil den er godkendt af en forælder eller "
"værge. Du modtager en e-mail, der beskriver de næste trin for at aktivere "
"din konto."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:52
msgid ""
"Beyond accepting the terms and conditions, you need to fill out some "
"important details such as selecting a username, entering your e-mail address"
" and desired password. You can also select your timezone and language."
msgstr ""
"Ud over at acceptere betingelserne, skal du udfylde nogle vigtige "
"oplysninger såsom brugernavn, e-mailadresse og ønsket adgangskode. Du kan "
"også vælge tidszone og sprog."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:53
msgid ""
"If you see in the form where you can specify your username, password etc. a "
"graphic with some odd-looking characters, then you are seeing the so-called "
"<emphasis>Visual Confirmation</emphasis>. Many boards will have this, "
"otherwise known as a <acronym>CAPTCHA</acronym>, which is an image with "
"distorted letters and numbers which you must then type into an adjacent box."
" The reason for this is to ensure that you are a legitimate user registering"
" (as opposed to a spam robot performing an automated registration). Simply "
"enter the characters you see into the <guilabel>Confirmation code</guilabel>"
" field and proceed with the registration. If you cannot understand the code,"
" refresh the page to get a new code."
msgstr ""
"Ser du i formularen, hvor du angiver brugernavn, adgangskode osv., en grafik"
" med nogle mærkelige tegn, ser du den såkaldte <emphasis>visuelle "
"bekræftelse</emphasis>. Mange boards har denne funktion, også kaldet "
"<acronym>CAPTCHA</acronym>, som er et billede med forvrængede bogstaver og "
"tal, som du skal indtaste i et felt ved siden af. Formålet er at sikre, at "
"du er en rigtig bruger, der tilmelder dig (i modsætning til en spamrobot, "
"der udfører en automatisk tilmelding). Indtast blot de tegn du ser i feltet "
"<guilabel>Bekræftelseskode</guilabel> og fortsæt tilmeldingen. Kan du ikke "
"tyde koden, kan du genindlæse siden for at få en ny kode."

