#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:65
msgid ""
"Another option available is the account activation. Here, the administrator "
"can make it a requirement that you have to follow a link mailed to you after"
" registering before your account is activated. In this case you will see a "
"message similiar to this one: <_:blockquote-1/> It is also possible that the"
" administrator himself/herself has to activate the account."
msgstr ""
