#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:80
msgid "Orienting Yourself in the User Control Panel"
msgstr "Bliv fortrolig med brugerkontrolpanelet"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:81
msgid ""
"The User Control Panel (<glossterm>UCP</glossterm>) allows you to alter "
"personal preferences, manage posts you are watching, send and receive "
"private messages, and change the way information about you appears to other "
"users. To view the UCP, click the 'User Control Panel' link that appears "
"after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Brugerkontrolpanelet (<glossterm>UCP</glossterm>) giver dig mulighed for at "
"ændre personlige indstillinger, administrere emner du overvåger, sende og "
"modtage private beskeder, samt ændre hvordan oplysninger om dig vises for "
"andre brugere. For at se UCP'en, klik på linket \"Brugerkontrolpanel\", som "
"fremgår efter du er logget ind."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:82
msgid ""
"The UCP is separated into six tabs: Overview, Private Messages, Profile, "
"Preferences, Friends and Foes, and Groups. Within each tab are several sub "
"pages, accessed by clicking the desired link on the left side of the UCP "
"interface. Some of these areas may not be available depending on the "
"permissions set for you by the administrator."
msgstr ""
"UCP'en er opdelt i seks faneblade: Oversigt, Private beskeder, Profil, "
"Boardindstillinger, Venner og ignorerede brugere, samt Grupper. Under hvert "
"faneblad findes adskillige undersider, som tilgås ved at klikke på det "
"ønskede link i venstre side af UCP-grænsefladen. Nogle af disse områder er "
"muligvis ikke tilgængelige, afhængigt af de tilladelser administratoren har "
"tildelt dig."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:83
msgid ""
"Every page of the UCP displays your Friends List on the left side. To send a"
" private message to a friend, click their user name."
msgstr ""
"Hver side i UCP'en viser din venneliste i venstre side. For at sende en "
"privat besked til en ven, klik på dennes brugernavn."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:84
msgid ""
"Private Messaging is discussed more in depth in <xref linkend=\"user_pm\"/>."
msgstr "Private beskeder gennemgås mere detaljeret i <xref linkend=\"user_pm\"/>."

