#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:102
msgid "Subscriptions"
msgstr "Overvågninger"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:103
msgid ""
"Subscriptions are forums or individual topics that you have elected to watch"
" for any new posts. Whenever a new post is made inside an area you have "
"subscribed to, an e-mail will be sent you to informing you of the new "
"addition. To create a subscription, visit the forum or topic you would like "
"to subscribe to and click the 'Subscribe' link located at the bottom of the "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Overvågninger er fora eller enkelte emner, du har valgt at overvåge for nye "
"indlæg. Når der skrives et nyt indlæg i et område du overvåger, sendes der "
"en e-mail, der informerer dig om det nye indlæg. For at oprette en "
"overvågning, besøg forummet eller emnet du ønsker at overvåge, og klik på "
"linket \"Overvåg\" nederst på siden."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:104
msgid ""
"To remove a subscription, check the box next to the subscription you would "
"like to remove and click the 'Unsubscribe' button."
msgstr ""
"For at fjerne en overvågning, sæt et mærke i boksen ved siden af den "
"overvågning du ønsker at fjerne, og klik på knappen \"Fjern overvågning\"."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:107
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Bogmærker"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:108
msgid ""
"Bookmarks, much like subscriptions, are topics you've chosen to watch. "
"However, there are two key differences: 1) only individual topics may be "
"bookmarked, and 2) an e-mail will not be sent to inform you of new posts."
msgstr ""
"Bogmærker er, ligesom overvågninger, emner du har valgt at følge. Der er dog"
" to vigtige forskelle: 1) kun enkelte emner kan bogmærkes, og 2) der sendes "
"ikke en e-mail for at informere dig om nye indlæg."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:109
msgid ""
"To create a bookmark, visit the topic you would like to watch and click the "
"'Bookmark Topic' link located at the bottom of the page."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette et bogmærke, besøg det emne du ønsker at følge, og klik på "
"linket \"Bogmærk emne\" nederst på siden."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:110
msgid ""
"To remove a bookmark, check the box next to the bookmark you would like to "
"remove and click the 'Remove marked bookmarks' button."
msgstr ""
"For at fjerne et bogmærke, sæt et mærke i boksen ved siden af det bogmærke "
"du ønsker at fjerne, og klik på knappen \"Fjern markerede bogmærker\"."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:113 user_guide.xml:419
msgid "Drafts"
msgstr "Kladder"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:114
msgid ""
"Drafts are created when you click the 'Save' button on the New Post or Post "
"Reply page. Displayed are the title of your post, the forum or topic that "
"the draft was made in, and the date you saved it."
msgstr ""
"Kladder oprettes, når du klikker på knappen \"Gem\" på siden for at skrive "
