"see. Think of your profile as a sign of your public presence. This section "
"is separated from your preferences. (Preferences are the individual settings"
" that you set and manage on your own, and control your forum experience. "
"Thus, this is separated from your profile settings.)"
msgstr ""
"Denne fane giver dig mulighed for at indstille dine profiloplysninger. Din "
"profil indeholder generelle oplysninger, som andre brugere på boardet kan "
"se. Betragt din profil som et udtryk for din offentlige tilstedeværelse. "
