#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:285
msgid "Friends and Foes"
msgstr "Venner og ignorerede brugere"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:286
msgid ""
"Users can be marked as a <guilabel>Friend</guilabel> or a "
"<guilabel>Foe</guilabel> in order to allow for filtering of their messages. "
"If a style supports it, posts made by users on your Foe list will be hidden "
"from view and posts from users on your Friend list will be highlighted. "
"Private Message rules can make use of the Friend and Foes list for filtering"
" incoming PMs."
msgstr ""
"Brugere kan markeres som <guilabel>Ven</guilabel> eller <guilabel>Ignoreret "
"bruger</guilabel> for at filtrere deres beskeder. Understøtter typografien "
"det, skjules indlæg fra brugere på din liste over ignorerede brugere, mens "
"indlæg fra brugere på din venneliste fremhæves. Regler for private beskeder "
"kan gøre brug af venne- og ignorerlisten til at filtrere indkommende "
"beskeder."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:289 user_guide.xml:395
msgid "Attachments"
msgstr "Vedhæftede filer"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:290
msgid ""
"The attachment section of the UCP shows a list of all attachments that you "
"have uploaded to the board. Each entry contains a link to the message in "
"which the attachment is contained, the size of the attachment, the number of"
" times it has been downloaded, and the time at which it was uploaded. "
"Through this page, you can delete attachments from the board. Inline "
"references to a deleted attachment will still remain in the original post, "
"but the attachment will not be rendered in any way other than the file name."
msgstr ""
"Sektionen for vedhæftede filer i UCP viser en liste over alle vedhæftede "
"filer, du har uploadet til boardet. Hver post indeholder et link til den "
"besked, den vedhæftede fil hører til, filens størrelse, antallet af gange "
"den er downloadet, samt tidspunktet for upload. Fra denne side kan du slette"
" vedhæftede filer fra boardet. Referencer til en slettet fil i indlægget "
"forbliver, men filen vises herefter kun som filnavn, uden andet indhold."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:293
msgid "Usergroups"
msgstr "Brugergrupper"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:294
msgid ""
"Usergroup membership can be managed through the Usergroups section of the "
"UCP. The page lists groups for which the user is a member of, a leader of, "
"and all other usergroups. Groups which are open for membership have a radio "
"button allowing the user to request membership. Users may also remove "
"themselves from groups in which they hold membership. If a user has the "
"<guilabel>Can change default usergroup</guilabel>, they change choose which "
"group to be their default here. The default usergroup dictates the user's "
"username color which is shown throughout the board."
msgstr ""
"Medlemskab af brugergrupper administreres via sektionen Brugergrupper i UCP."
" Siden viser de grupper, brugeren er medlem af, leder for, samt alle øvrige "
"brugergrupper. Grupper, der er åbne for medlemskab, har en radioknap, så "
"brugeren kan anmode om medlemskab. Brugere kan også fjerne sig selv fra "
"grupper, de er medlem af. Har brugeren tilladelsen <guilabel>Kan ændre "
"standardbrugergruppe</guilabel>, kan brugeren her vælge hvilken gruppe der "
"skal være dennes standardgruppe. Standardbrugergruppen bestemmer farven på "
"brugerens brugernavn, som vises overalt på boardet."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:295
msgid ""
"Users who are designated as a group leader are able to manage the group's "
"membership. Users can be added, removed, pending join requests can be "
"approved or denied, and have their default usergroup changed here."
msgstr ""
"Brugere udpeget som gruppeleder kan administrere gruppens medlemskab. Her "
"kan brugere tilføjes, fjernes, ventende medlemskabsanmodninger godkendes "
"eller afvises, samt medlemmers standardbrugergruppe ændres."

