#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:326
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Topic/Post Icon</guilabel>: The topic/post icon is a small icon "
"that will display to the left of your post subject. This helps identify your"
" post and make it stand out, though it is completely optional."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Emne/Indlægsikon</guilabel>: Emne-/indlægsikonet er et lille "
"billede, der vises til venstre for dit emne. Det hjælper med at identificere"
" dit indlæg og få det til at skille sig ud, men er helt valgfrit."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:327
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Subject</guilabel>: If you are creating a new topic with your "
"post, the subject is required and will become the title of the topic. If you"
" are replying to an existing topic, this is optional, but it can be changed."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Emne</guilabel>: Skriver du et nyt emne, er angivelse af emne "
"obligatorisk og bliver titlen på emnet. Svarer du på et eksisterende emne, "
"er feltet valgfrit, men kan ændres."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:328
msgid ""
"Post Content - While not being labeled, the large text box is where your "
"actual post content will be entered. Here, along with your text, you may use"
" things like <link linkend=\"posting_smilies\">Smilies</link> or <link "
"linkend=\"posting_bbcodes\">BBCode</link> if the board administrator has "
"them enabled. Content entered as HTML will be rendered as text, HTML input "
"is not supported."
msgstr ""
"Indlægsindhold - Selvom det ikke er mærket, er den store tekstboks hvor "
"selve dit indlæg skrives. Her kan du, ud over almindelig tekst, bruge ting "
"som <link linkend=\"posting_smilies\">smileys</link> eller <link "
"linkend=\"posting_bbcodes\">BBkode</link>, hvis boardadministratoren har "
"aktiveret dem. Indhold indtastet som HTML vises som almindelig tekst, HTML-"
"input understøttes ikke."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:329
msgid ""
"Smilies - Smilies, or emoticons, are small images which can be inserted into"
" your post to add expression emphasis. If Smilies are enabled, you will see "
"the text \"<guilabel>Smilies are ON</guilabel>\" to the righthand of the "
"Post Content box. Otherwise, you will see the text \"<guilabel>Smilies are "
"OFF</guilabel>.\" See <link linkend=\"posting_smilies\">Posting "
"Smilies</link> for further details."
msgstr ""
"Smileys - Smileys, eller emotikoner, er små billeder som kan indsættes i dit"
" indlæg for at tilføje følelsesmæssigt udtryk. Er smileys aktiveret, ser du "
"teksten \"<guilabel>Smileys er TIL</guilabel>\" til højre for feltet "
"Indlægsindhold. Ellers ser du teksten \"<guilabel>Smileys er "
"FRA</guilabel>.\" Se <link linkend=\"posting_smilies\">Smileys</link> for "
"flere detaljer."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:330
msgid ""
"BBCode - BBCode is a type of formatting that can be applied to your post "
"content if BBCode has been enabled by the board administrator. If BBCode is "
"enabled, you will see the text \"<guilabel>BBCode is ON</guilabel>\" to the "
"righthand of the Post Content box. Otherwise, you will see the text "
"\"<guilabel>BBCode is OFF</guilabel>.\" See <link "
"linkend=\"posting_bbcodes\">Posting BBCode</link> for further details."
msgstr ""
"BBkode - BBkode er en formateringsmetode, der kan anvendes i dit indlæg, "
"hvis BBkode er aktiveret af boardadministratoren. Er BBkode aktiveret, ser "
"du teksten \"<guilabel>BBkode er TIL</guilabel>\" til højre for feltet "
"Indlægsindhold. Ellers ser du teksten \"<guilabel>BBkode er "
"FRA</guilabel>.\" Se <link linkend=\"posting_bbcodes\">BBkoder</link> for "
"flere detaljer."

