#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:336
msgid ""
"Smilies, or emoticons, are small images which can be inserted into your post"
" to add expression emphasis. To use Smiles, certain characters are put "
"together to get the desired output. For example, typing :) will insert "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/smile.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>,"
" ;) will insert <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/wink.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>,"
" etc. Other smilies require the format :texthere: to display. For example, "
":roll: will insert smilie whose eyes are rolling: "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/rolleyes.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>,"
" and :cry: will insert a smilie who is crying: "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/cry.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>."
msgstr ""
"Smileys, eller emotikoner, er små billeder som kan indsættes i dit indlæg "
"for at tilføje følelsesmæssigt udtryk. For at bruge smileys sammensættes "
"bestemte tegn for at opnå det ønskede resultat. Skriver du f.eks. :) "
"indsættes <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/smile.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>,"
" ;) indsætter <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/wink.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>,"
" osv. Andre smileys kræver formatet :tekst_her: for at blive vist. F.eks. "
"indsætter :roll: en smiley med rullende øjne: "
"<inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/rolleyes.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>,"
" og :cry: en grædende smiley: <inlinemediaobject><imageobject><imagedata "
"fileref=\"../images/user_guide/smilies/cry.gif\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:337
msgid ""
"In many cases you can also select which smilie you'd like to insert by "
"clicking its picture on the right side of the Post Content text box. When "
"clicked, the smilie's characters will appear at the current location of the "
"curser in the text box."
msgstr ""
"I mange tilfælde kan du også vælge den ønskede smiley ved at klikke på dens "
"billede i højre side af feltet Indlægsindhold. Ved klik indsættes smileyens "
"tegnkode på markørens aktuelle placering i tekstfeltet."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:338
msgid ""
"If you wish to be able to use these characters in your post, but not have "
"them appear as smilies, please see <link linkend=\"posting_options\">Posting"
" Options</link>."
msgstr ""
"Ønsker du at bruge disse tegnkombinationer i dit indlæg, uden at de vises "
"som smileys, se venligst <link "
"linkend=\"posting_options\">Indlægsindstillinger</link>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:342
msgid "BBCodes"
msgstr "BBkoder"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:343
msgid ""
"BBCode is a type of formatting that can be applied to your post content, "
"much like HTML. Unlike HTML, however, BBCode uses square brackets [ and ] "
"instead of angled brackets &lt; and &gt;. Depending on the permissions the "
"board administrator has set, you may be able to use only certain BBCodes or "
"even none at all."
msgstr ""
"BBkode er en formateringsmetode, der kan anvendes på dit indlægsindhold, "
"meget lig HTML. I modsætning til HTML bruger BBkode dog hakparenteser [ og ]"
" i stedet for vinkelparenteser &lt; og &gt;. Afhængigt af de tilladelser "
"boardadministratoren har fastsat, kan du muligvis kun bruge bestemte "
"BBkoder, eller slet ingen."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:344
msgid ""
"For detailed instructions on the usage of BBCode, you can click the "
"<guilabel>BBCode</guilabel> link to the righthand of the Post Content text "
"box. Please note that the administrator has the option to add new and custom"
" BBCodes, so others may be availible to you which are not on this list."
msgstr ""
"For detaljeret vejledning i brugen af BBkode, kan du klikke på linket "
"<guilabel>BBkode</guilabel> til højre for feltet Indlægsindhold. Bemærk at "
"administratoren har mulighed for at tilføje nye og brugerdefinerede BBkoder,"
" så flere kan være tilgængelige for dig end dem på denne liste."

