#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:479
msgid "Message Folders"
msgstr "Beskedmapper"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:480
msgid ""
"Just like in your e-mail client, all <glossterm>private messages</glossterm>"
" are stored in folders. Working with folders is similar to working with "
"forums in phpBB 3.3. The <guilabel>Inbox</guilabel> is your default incoming"
" message folder. All messages you receive will appear in here."
msgstr ""
"Ligesom i din e-mailklient gemmes alle <glossterm>private "
"beskeder</glossterm> i mapper. At arbejde med mapper minder om at arbejde "
"med fora i phpBB 3.3. <guilabel>Indbakken</guilabel> er din "
"standardmodtagemappe. Alle beskeder du modtager, vises her."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:481
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Sent messages</guilabel> will appear in either the "
"<guilabel>Outbox</guilabel> or the <guilabel>Sent messages</guilabel> "
"folder. As long as the recipient(s) have not yet read the message, it will "
"stay in the <guilabel>Outbox</guilabel>. As soon as someone reads the "
"message it will be archived to the <guilabel>Sent messages</guilabel> "
"folder. If the administrator allows it, you can edit messages after sending "
"them as long as they are in the <guilabel>Outbox</guilabel> and the "
"recipients have not yet read them."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Sendte beskeder</guilabel> vises enten i mappen "
"<guilabel>Udbakke</guilabel> eller <guilabel>Sendte beskeder</guilabel>. Så "
"længe modtageren/modtagerne endnu ikke har læst beskeden, forbliver den i "
"<guilabel>Udbakken</guilabel>. Så snart nogen læser beskeden, arkiveres den "
"til mappen <guilabel>Sendte beskeder</guilabel>. Tillader administratoren "
"det, kan du redigere beskeder, efter de er sendt, så længe de er i "
"<guilabel>Udbakken</guilabel>, og modtagerne endnu ikke har læst dem."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:482
msgid ""
"Each folder, including <guilabel>Sent messages</guilabel> and "
"<guilabel>Outbox</guilabel>, can hold a board-defined amount of messages. "
"This is a global setting that only a board administrator can change. An info"
" text displays the current number of allowed messages and the current "
"percentage of space your messages are using at the top of each folder. If no"
" restriction is displayed, you are allowed unlimited messages in each "
"folder."
msgstr ""
"Hver mappe, inklusive <guilabel>Sendte beskeder</guilabel> og "
"<guilabel>Udbakke</guilabel>, kan indeholde et af boardet fastsat antal "
"beskeder. Dette er en global indstilling, som kun en boardadministrator kan "
"ændre. En infotekst viser det aktuelle antal tilladte beskeder samt den "
"nuværende procentdel af pladsen dine beskeder bruger, øverst i hver mappe. "
"Vises der ingen begrænsning, har du ubegrænset plads i den pågældende mappe."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: user_guide.xml:484
msgid ""
"Please note that the total amount of messages allowed is a per-folder "
"setting. You can have multiple folders which each allow 50 messages for "
"instance. If you have 3 folders, your actual global limit is 150 messages, "
"but each folder can only contain up to 50 messages by itself. It is not "
"possible to merge folders and have one with more messages than the limit."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk at det tilladte antal beskeder er en indstilling pr. mappe. Du kan "
"have flere mapper, som hver tillader 50 beskeder. Har du 3 mapper, er din "
"reelle globale grænse 150 beskeder, men hver mappe kan kun indeholde op til "
"50 beskeder i sig selv. Det er ikke muligt at sammenlægge mapper og få én "
"med flere beskeder end grænsen tillader."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:495
msgid "Custom Folders"
msgstr "Brugerdefinerede mapper"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:497
msgid ""
"If the administrator allows it, you can create your own custom "
"<glossterm>private message</glossterm> folders in phpBB 3.3. To check "
"whether you can add folders, visit the <guimenuitem>Edit "
"options</guimenuitem> section of the <guilabel>private message</guilabel> "
"area."
msgstr ""
"Tillader administratoren det, kan du oprette dine egne brugerdefinerede "
"mapper til <glossterm>private beskeder</glossterm> i phpBB 3.3. For at "
"tjekke om du kan tilføje mapper, besøg sektionen "
"<guimenuitem>Redigeringsmuligheder</guimenuitem> under <guilabel>private "
"beskeder</guilabel>."

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:498
msgid ""
"To add a new folder, enter the folder's name into the <guilabel>Add "
"folder</guilabel> input box. If creation was successful, your new folder "
"will appear at the bottom of the folder list. You can then use it like a "
"normal message folder and move messages into it or set a filter (see the "
"section on <link linkend=\"pm_rules\">Private Message Rules</link> for more "
"information about filters) to automatically do it for you."
msgstr ""
"For at oprette en ny mappe skrives navnet på den i feltet <guilabel>Tilføj "
"mappe</guilabel>. Lykkedes oprettelsen, vises din nye mappe nederst på "
"mappelisten. Du kan herefter bruge den som en almindelig beskedmappe og "
"flytte beskeder til den, eller oprette et filter (se afsnittet om <link "
"linkend=\"pm_rules\">Regler for private beskeder</link> for mere information"
" om filtre), der automatisk gør det for dig."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:509
msgid "Moving Messages"
msgstr "Flytning af beskeder"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:511
msgid ""
"It wouldn't make sense to have custom folders if you weren't able to move "
"messages between them. To do exactly that, visit the folder from which you "
"want to move the messages away. Select the messages you want to move, and "
"use the <guilabel>Moved marked</guilabel> pull-down menu to select the "
"destination folder."
msgstr ""
"Det ville ikke give mening at have brugerdefinerede mapper, hvis du ikke "
"kunne flytte beskeder mellem dem. For netop at gøre dette, besøg den mappe "
"du vil flytte beskederne fra. Vælg de beskeder du vil flytte, og brug "
"dropdownmenuen <guilabel>Flyt markerede</guilabel> til at vælge "
"destinationsmappen."

#. (itstool) path: note/para
#: user_guide.xml:513
msgid ""
"Please note that if after the move, the destination folder would have more "
"messages in it than the message limit allows, you will receive an error "
"message and the move will be discarded."
msgstr ""
"Bemærk venligst at er destinationsmappen herefter fyldt over det tilladte "
"antal beskeder, modtager du en fejlbesked, og flytningen annulleres."

