#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:652
msgid "Search - How to Find What You are Looking For"
msgstr "Søgning - find det du leder efter"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:653
msgid ""
"As the board grows and accumulates posts, it becomes difficult to find "
"specific content quickly. To aid in finding posts, phpBB contains a search "
"utility. Common searches are offered in the form of links on the index (new "
"posts, unanswered posts, etc.), keyword searches can be performed from the "
"header, forum view, and topic view (in supported styles), and custom search "
"queries can be created using the Advanced Search feature."
msgstr ""
"Efterhånden som boardet vokser og akkumulerer indlæg, bliver det svært "
"hurtigt at finde specifikt indhold. For at hjælpe med at finde indlæg "
"indeholder phpBB et søgeværktøj. Almindelige søgninger tilbydes som links på"
" indekset (nye indlæg, ubesvarede indlæg osv.), søgning på nøgleord kan "
"udføres fra headeren, forumvisningen og emnevisningen (i understøttede "
"typografier), og brugerdefinerede søgeforespørgsler kan oprettes med den "
"avancerede søgefunktion."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:656
msgid "Predefined searches"
msgstr "Foruddefinerede søgninger"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:657
msgid ""
"phpBB comes with several predefined searches to easily perform certain types"
" of queries."
msgstr ""
"phpBB leveres med flere foruddefinerede søgninger, så du nemt kan udføre "
"visse typer forespørgsler."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:659
msgid ""
"<guilabel>View your posts</guilabel> - Returns a list of topics that you "
"have posted in, sorted by the time of the last post in the topic."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Se dine indlæg</guilabel> - Viser en liste over emner, du har "
"skrevet indlæg i, sorteret efter tidspunktet for det seneste indlæg i emnet."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:660
msgid ""
"<guilabel>View unanswered topics</guilabel> - Returns all topics which "
"contain no replies."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Se ubesvarede emner</guilabel> - Viser alle emner, der ikke har "
"nogen svar."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:661
msgid ""
"<guilabel>View unread posts</guilabel> - Returns a list of topics containing"
" posts which you have yet to read."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Se ulæste indlæg</guilabel> - Viser en liste over emner med "
"indlæg, du endnu ikke har læst."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:662
msgid ""
"<guilabel>View new posts</guilabel> - Returns a list of topics containing "
"posts which have been made since the last time you logged in."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Se nye indlæg</guilabel> - Viser en liste over emner med indlæg, "
"der er skrevet siden du sidst loggede ind."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:663
msgid ""
"<guilabel>View active topics</guilabel> - Returns a list of topics which "
"have been posted in during the last few days. The number of days can be "
"changed after loading the search page."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Aktive emner</guilabel> - Viser en liste over emner, der har fået "
"indlæg i løbet af de seneste dage. Antallet af dage kan ændres efter "
"søgesiden er indlæst."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
