#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: user_guide.xml:712
msgid "+dog -cat"
msgstr "+hund -kat"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:714
msgid "Returns results which contain the word \"dog\", but not \"cat\"."
msgstr "Viser resultater der indeholder ordet \"hund\", men ikke \"kat\"."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: user_guide.xml:721
msgid "|"
msgstr "|"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:723
msgid ""
"This token can be used to separate a list of keywords, of which at least one"
" of the keywords should be found in the text. Words may be placed inside of "
"parentheses and combined with a + or - to indicated that at least one of the"
" words must or must not appear in each result."
msgstr ""
"Dette tegn kan bruges til at adskille en liste af nøgleord, hvoraf mindst ét"
" af nøgleordene skal findes i teksten. Ord kan placeres i parenteser og "
"kombineres med et + eller - for at angive, at mindst ét af ordene skal eller"
" ikke må forekomme i hvert resultat."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: user_guide.xml:727
msgid "dog|cat"
msgstr "hund|kat"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:729
msgid "Returns results which contain either the word \"dog\" or the word \"cat\"."
msgstr "Viser resultater der indeholder enten ordet \"hund\" eller ordet \"kat\"."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: user_guide.xml:733
msgid "-(dog|cat)"
msgstr "-(hund|kat)"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:735
msgid "Returns results which contain neither the word \"dog\" nor the word \"cat\"."
msgstr "Viser resultater der hverken indeholder ordet \"hund\" eller ordet \"kat\"."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: user_guide.xml:742
msgid "*"
msgstr "*"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:744
msgid "An asterisk in a keyword allows for partial keyword matches."
msgstr "En stjerne i et nøgleord giver mulighed for delvise nøgleordsmatch."

#. (itstool) path: varlistentry/term
#: user_guide.xml:748
msgid "cat*"
msgstr "kat*"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:750
msgid ""
"Returns results which begin with the word \"cat\", such as \"cats\" and "
"\"catastrophe\"."
msgstr ""
"Viser resultater der begynder med ordet \"kat\", såsom \"katte\" og "
"\"katastrofe\"."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:760
msgid "Author"
msgstr "Forfatter"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:761
msgid ""
"The search query can be further refined by providing the author of the post."
" If an author is specified, then only posts made by that author which meets "
"the query requirements will be returned. The author field allows for the use"
" of wildcards (*) to perform partial matches on the author name."
msgstr ""
"Søgeforespørgslen kan indsnævres yderligere ved at angive forfatteren af "
"indlægget. Angives en forfatter, returneres kun indlæg skrevet af denne "
"forfatter, som opfylder forespørgslens krav. Feltet Forfatter tillader brug "
"af jokertegn (*) til delvise match på forfatterens navn."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: user_guide.xml:766
msgid "The search options"
msgstr "Søgemulighederne"

#. (itstool) path: section/para
#: user_guide.xml:767
msgid ""
"Searches can be further restricted to specific forums or specific parts of "
"the topics."
msgstr ""
"Søgninger kan yderligere begrænses til bestemte fora eller bestemte dele af "
"emnerne."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:769
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Search in forums</guilabel> - Here you can select specific forums "
"in which the search should be performed. Multiple forums can be selected by "
"holding down the \"control\" or \"command\" key."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Søg i fora</guilabel> - Her kan du vælge specifikke fora, "
"søgningen skal udføres i. Flere fora kan vælges ved at holde \"Ctrl\"- eller"
" \"Cmd\"-tasten nede."

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: user_guide.xml:770
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Search in subforums</guilabel> - If this option is selected, then "
"any subforums of the selected forums will be searched as well."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Søg i underfora</guilabel> - Er denne mulighed valgt, gennemsøges "
